    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_930 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ r > 0, ∃ k, ∀ I₁ I₂ : Fin r → ℕ,\n      (∀ i : Fin r, 0 < I₁ i ∧ I₁ i + k ≤ I₂ i + 1) →\n        (∀ i j : Fin r, i < j → I₂ i < I₁ j) →\n          ¬ IsPower (∏ i : Fin r, ∏ m ∈ Icc (I₁ i) (I₂ i), m)",
